ulls, compact reset proof, TC-4.1 through TC-4.6, seam-isolation sibling leg, both host modes, status zone sum consistency, and Boundary G1 trajectory golden. Do not add a host-called advance surface. Keep changes scoped and run the configured story gate `pnpm run green-verify` before returning evidence.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After implementor returns, check for required evidence: TC-4.1-4.6, seam isolation both directions, both host modes, G1 golden, status sum consistency, and green-verify output before deciding verify or quick-fix.\\\"}\"}}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/04-tool-result-visibility/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:7:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Implementation reports ready-for-verification with green-verify and verify-all passing, but there is no verifier result yet. The smallest safe next action is an independent verification pass against the story requirements and implementor artifact.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/04-tool-result-visibility/003-implementor.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify TC-4.1 through TC-4.6, seam isolation both directions, both host modes, Boundary G1 golden, deleted-filter status/advance consistency, budget validation, no host-called advance surface, and green-verify evidence.\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\"}}\"}}\npackages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts:139:      form: \"tool_result_summary\",\npackages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/handlers.ts:155:  tool_result_summary: toolResultSummaryHandler,\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:26:Migration v6 (view, band, boundary tables), profile config par