{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/snapshot.ts | sed -n '150,202p'\"","aggregated_output":"   150\t  compactPoint: number;\n   151\t  coveredFrom: number;\n   152\t  profileName: string | null;\n   153\t  configJson: string;\n   154\t  arrangementJson: string;\n   155\t  gapsJson: string;\n   156\t  sourceStateJson: string;\n   157\t  bands: Array<{ band: Band; renderedText: string; tokenCount: number }>;\n   158\t}\n   159\t\n   160\t// Compact's one transaction: delete the singleton view row (the FK cascade\n   161\t// drops its bands), insert the new header and bands, and reset the boundary\n   162\t// to the compact point (AC-4.7) — all inside one BEGIN IMMEDIATE, so a crash\n   163\t// anywhere rolls the whole replace back and the previous view keeps serving\n   164\t// (AC-2.6, TC-2.4). Compact is the only writer of these rows; the boundary's\n   165\t// other writer is Story 4's advance.\n   166\texport function replaceViewSnapshot(db: DatabaseSync, input: ViewReplaceInput): void {\n   167\t  db.exec(\"BEGIN IMMEDIATE;\");\n   168\t  try {\n   169\t    db.prepare(`DELETE FROM thread_view WHERE singleton = 1`).run();\n   170\t    db.prepare(\n   171\t      `INSERT INTO thread_view (singleton, view_id, created_at, compact_point, covered_from,\n   172\t         profile_name, config_json, arrangement_json, gaps_json, source_state_json)\n   173\t       VALUES (1, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)`,\n   174\t    ).run(\n   175\t      input.viewId,\n   176\t      input.createdAt,\n   177\t      input.compactPoint,\n   178\t      input.coveredFrom,\n   179\t      input.profileName,\n   180\t      input.configJson,\n   181\t      input.arrangementJson,\n   182\t      input.gapsJson,\n   183\t      input.sourceStateJson,\n   184\t    );\n   185\t    const insertBand = db.prepare(\n   186\t      `INSERT INTO thread_view_band (view_id, band, rendered_text, token_count)\n   187\t       VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)`,\n   188\t    );\n   189\t    for (const band of input.bands) {\n   190\t      insertBand.run(input.viewId, band.band, band.renderedText, band.tokenCount);\n   191\t    }\n   192\t    db.prepare(\n   193\t      `UPDATE view_boundary SET position = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE thread_singleton = 1`,\n   194\t    ).run(input.compactPoint, input.createdAt);\n   195\t    db.exec(\"COMMIT;\");\n   196\t  } catch (cause) {\n   197\t    db.exec(\"ROLLBACK;\");\n   198\t    throw cause;\n   199\t  }\n   200\t}\n   201\t\n   202\t// Ready tool-result summaries by message id — the short-form ladder's first\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
